<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-tarp.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-tarp-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-tarp.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="765" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Services</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services in Maryland</h1><p class="lede">Twelve services built around one job: an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss — whether we act as your appraiser, review the insurer’s estimate or sit as a neutral umpire.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn brass" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/start-a-claim-review/">Request a free review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="igrid" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/appraisal-demand-representation/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/signing.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/signing-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/signing.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">01</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Appraisal Demand Representation</h2><p>We serve as your appointed appraiser once you or your insurer invokes the appraisal clause on a Maryland property claim.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/foursquare-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/foursquare-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/foursquare-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">02</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Home Insurance Appraisal</h2><p>Independent appraisal for underpaid homeowners and condo claims, from Baltimore rowhouses to Deep Creek Lake cabins.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">03</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for condo associations, HOAs, landlords and business owners with large or multi-building property losses.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/shingles.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="526" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">04</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for hail and roof claims where the carrier pays for spot repairs but the roof really needs replacement or matching.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/windstorm-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">05</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Windstorm &amp; Tornado Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for derecho, straight-line wind and tornado losses – roofs, siding, framing and the debris left behind.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/hurricane-noreaster-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-dock.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-dock-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-dock.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">06</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Hurricane &amp; Nor’easter Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for wind-driven losses from hurricanes, tropical storms and nor’easters along the Bay, the coast and inland.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">07</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Water Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for burst pipes, appliance leaks and storm-driven water losses where drying, tear-out or rebuild costs are disputed.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">08</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for fire, smoke and soot losses, including rowhouse fires that spread through party walls to neighboring homes.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/snow-ice-dam-freeze-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">09</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Snow, Ice Dam &amp; Freeze Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for snow-load roof collapse, ice-dam leaks and frozen or burst pipes – worst in Garrett and Allegany counties.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/tree-impact-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/trees-down.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/trees-down-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/trees-down.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="576" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">10</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Tree Impact Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for oaks, tulip poplars and big limbs that land on roofs, decks, fences and garages after Maryland storms.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">11</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Carrier Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of your insurer’s estimate before you decide whether demanding appraisal is worth it.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-services/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n">12</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Neutral Umpire Services</h2><p>Impartial umpire service for Maryland property appraisals when both party appraisers jointly ask us to serve.</p><span class="more">View service <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Where to start</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that difference is worth. A review answers that quickly, and many disputes are settled with a documented supplement at that stage.</p><a class="btn" href="/property-claim-services/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one step only?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and HOA properties?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes — condominium and townhome associations, apartment buildings, retail, office, churches and light industrial properties, as well as single-family homes.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you work on flood claims?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Flood policies, usually through the National Flood Insurance Program, have their own procedures. We focus on homeowners and commercial property policies, including wind-driven rain and storm damage that isn’t flood.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section><section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>An estimate that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send the insurer’s estimate and your photos. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — no obligation.</p></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn brass" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/start-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
</main>
